    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Invariants \u2014 these should never move",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 81
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 82
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**mTLS** should be a dead-flat 100%. A dip means failover broke identity, or workloads came back unmeshed \u2014 the most under-reported failure here.\n\n**Certificate headroom** is how long a cluster serves with `linkerd-identity` down. FM1b's survival window, and a runbook number."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "mTLS coverage",
      "description": "TWO windows on purpose. The 5m series is the sustained view; the 1m series is what is happening now. A resolved mTLS dip looks identical to an ongoing one for a full five minutes on the 5m window alone, so anyone reading this live during a game day will misjudge it. Measured after a real incident on 2026-08-27: with plaintext already stopped, 1m read clean while the wider window was still depressed. If 1m is 100% and 5m is not, the incident is over and you are looking at its tail. Both below 100% means it is still happening.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dr-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 86
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 99
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(response_total{direction=\"outbound\", authority=~\"(app-federated|app-flat-east|app-flat-west|app-gateway-east-gw)\\\\..*\", tls=\"true\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(response_total{direction=\"outbound\", authority=~\"(app-federated|app-flat-east|app-flat-west|app-gateway-east-gw)\\\\..*\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "mTLS % (5m, sustained)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(response_total{direction=\"outbound\", authority=~\"(app-federated|app-flat-east|app-flat-west|app-gateway-east-gw)\\\\..*\", tls=\"true\"}[1m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(response_total{direction=\"outbound\", authority=~\"(app-federated|app-flat-east|app-flat-west|app-gateway-east-gw)\\\\..*\"}[1m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "mTLS % (1m, recent)",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Certificate headroom (hours)",
      "description": "How long each cluster's data plane can keep serving if `linkerd-identity` goes away. Measured at rest here: 23h50m.\n\nThis is FM1b's real survival window, and the number that belongs in the runbook.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dr-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 86
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5
          },
          "unit": "h",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 6
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 12
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min by (cluster) (control_identity_cert_expiration_timestamp_seconds - time()) / 3600",
          "legendFormat": "{{cluster}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
