      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Nothing collected these before: linkerd-viz skips `linkerd-multicluster`, and the admin port is default-deny.\n\nOnly links that *have* a gateway are plotted \u2014 a flat link reports `gateway_alive=0` forever. If probe latency crosses the timeout, the gateway is marked dead though nothing failed."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Gateway reachability  \u2190 the metric nothing was collecting",
      "description": "`gateway_alive`, from the service mirror controllers. Nothing collected this before: linkerd-viz doesn't scrape `linkerd-multicluster`, and the admin port returns 403 behind a default-deny Server.\n\nOnly links with `gateway_enabled=1` are plotted \u2014 a flat (remote-discovery) link has no gateway and reports 0 forever.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dr-prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 97
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "alive",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "No gateway links from this cluster"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "gateway_alive and on (target_cluster_name) (gateway_enabled == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "{{target_cluster_name}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Gateway probe latency p95",
      "description": "How long the mirror controller's probe to each gateway takes. Baseline here is 1.7ms.\n\nIf this crosses the probe timeout the gateway is marked dead and traffic stops, even though nothing about the gateway failed (linkerd/linkerd2#8590). Watch it during FM3.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dr-prom"
